# The screen ray of the lamps (../README.md, "Шаг 4"; shader/lighting/lamp_contact.glsl): every view as two shots of
# one camera, `-off` without the ray (`vsm study 32`) and `-on` the game's. The hero's face and feet at a torch,
# things by a candle, his feet at a lantern at night.
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_LIGHT_FREEZE=1 TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen \
#     OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<the working content> scripts/bench.sh <this file> <out>
# Sheets: tools/lamp_contact_sheets.py <out> <sheets dir>
# @timeout 900
seed 73013
cheat god
blink off
overlay off
# 1. Xardas' tower, the torch
set time 12 0
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam cut
cam face 70 0 1
vsm study 32
wait 2500
shot face-front-off
wait 400
vsm study 0
wait 1500
shot face-front-on
wait 400
cam cut
cam face 70 45 1
vsm study 32
wait 2500
shot face-34-off
wait 400
vsm study 0
wait 1500
shot face-34-on
wait 400
